        <title>Zola 정적 사이트에 Google Analytics 적용하기</title>
        <published>2026-01-21T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-01-21T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>
            
              Unknown
            
          </name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://changki123.github.io/blog/260124-01-serverless/"/>
